Qualification package candidates
--------------------------------

The DogwoodSharp 0.0.0-discovery.1 qualification candidate contains native
Dogwood bridge images and their manifests for win-x64, linux-x64, and
osx-arm64. The experimental DogwoodSharp.CedarSharp 0.0.0-experimental.1
candidate depends on that stable candidate and CedarSharp 1.0.0; it does not
repackage CedarSharp.

The native bridge is built from dogwood-policy/dogwood 1.1.2 at revision
929f49e7305534ac61ef06cf8e47269c596dc851 with Cedar 4.11.0. The applicable
Apache-2.0 license and upstream attribution remain in force. This NOTICE is
not represented as the complete resolved native dependency license/notice
inventory; a complete inventory must be collected and reviewed before any
distribution decision.

These packages are qualification candidates only. Their presence in a local
candidate directory or CI artifact is **not authorization to publish, sign,
tag, release, or distribute** them. Publication requires a separate owner
authorization after independent qualification and completion of the release
gates.

See docs/architecture/native-artifacts.md for the exact native identities and
docs/ci-publishing.md for the producer package gate.
